 capital list puts a payback number next to each project. If it doesn't=0Aa=
lso name the person who'll run that project after the installer leaves, no =
one=0Ais on record to deliver the payback.=0A=0AThis week's question=0A=0AD=
oes your 2027 capital list name who will run each project=3F=0A=0AYes, ever=
y project=0A[https://tally.so/r/RWG6Jl=3Fanswer=3DYes%2C%20every%20project&=
